text.menu_pause.backpack=Backpack skins will have a chance to appear as rewards in various chests scattered around the world, specifically in the chests of the blacksmith shops in the villages, where players can find them as an additional incentive when exploring these structures, in the ancient cities, which represent a considerable challenge to those who venture within them, granting a special reward for the risk taken, in the pyramids of the desert, which contain hidden treasures beneath their traps, and in the treasure chests that are found buried and require maps to be located, adding a layer of exploration and adventure to the game. Meanwhile, custom music discs, which will allow players to enjoy unique and personalized melodies in-game, can be found exclusively in the loot of the trial chambers, making these structures a key place for those who wish to add exclusive musical content to their experience.